          "settings": {
            "question": "Is this really wildcrafted from Jamaica?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes \u2014 every herb is handpicked from Jamaican soil. Never farmed, never synthetic. We work directly with Jamaican harvesters to ensure quality and authenticity at the source.</p>"
