          "settings": {
            "question": "How long will one pack of Herbal Iron last?",
            "answer": "<p>One pack provides approximately <strong>30 servings</strong> and should last about <strong>1 month</strong> when taken at the recommended daily serving. Your actual usage may vary slightly depending on how you measure each serving</p>"
